[00:01.932](Turn it up)
[00:12.486]Somebody save your soul cause you've been sinning in this city I know
{"谁来拯救你的灵魂 因我知你在这城市罪孽深重"}
[00:17.036]Too many troubles, all these lovers got you losing control
{"太多麻烦 这些情人让你逐渐失控"}
[00:20.079]You're like a drug to me, a luxury, my sugar and gold
{"你于我如毒品般致命 如奢侈品般珍贵 是我的蜜糖与黄金"}
[00:23.443]I want the good life
{"我渴望美好生活"}
[00:25.137]Every good night you're a hard one to hold
{"每个难熬的夜晚你都难以捉摸"}
[00:27.684]Cause you don't even know
